  <text id="title" x="58" y="40" width="980" height="46" font="heading" size="30" color="ink" wrap="false">Field continuity strengthens FCT oversight</text>
  <text id="subtitle" x="58" y="86" width="1092" height="30" font="body" size="16" color="muted">A federal-grade land platform must continue across field verification, evidence capture, and inspection follow-through, especially when regularisation and title issues move outside the office.</text>

  <shape id="shot-frame" type="rect" x="58" y="146" width="560" height="428" fill="paper" stroke="border" stroke-width="1" shadow="true"/>
  <image id="shot" src="https://private-us-east-1.manuscdn.com/sessionFile/i7Z8860JB409ZwkKDDtAu7/sandbox/slides_resource_ilxvirqgh4ifccy9plf8t-99b462a3-e2b-prod-us2_1784584321736_na1fn_L2hvbWUvdWJ1bnR1L2lkbHJfcHRzX21vYmlsZS9wcmVzZW50YXRpb25fYXNzZXRzL2ZpZWxkX3NlZWRlZF92MQ.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1560,h_1560/format,webp&Expires=1786752000&__&Key-Pair-Id=K2QY5QTL8JSY6C&Signature=MEUCIBDg3YH4qXL~~93andjMasILNRz8mVwouuUhTo7ibs9oAiEA~77~nFy8bBrywOBcA59DB5fy9rydgPTdkLNL2PeQEJM_" x="74" y="170" width="528" height="380" fit="cover"/>
  <text id="shot-label" x="74" y="154" width="528" height="14" font="caption" size="11" color="muted" align="center" wrap="false">Real application screenshot • field mission workflow with low-connectivity, evidence, and sync-aware execution</text>

  <shape id="card1" type="rect" x="654" y="146" width="568" height="122" fill="surface" stroke="border" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="card1t" x="680" y="170" width="516" height="76" font="body" size="18" color="ink" line-height="1.3"><p><strong color="brand">Regularisation support</strong></p><p space-before="10">Field missions can support land-document checks, physical parcel verification, and issue capture when desk review needs stronger ground truth.</p></text>

  <shape id="card2" type="rect" x="654" y="292" width="568" height="122" fill="surface" stroke="border" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="card2t" x="680" y="316" width="516" height="76" font="body" size="18" color="ink" line-height="1.3"><p><strong color="brand">Evidence continuity</strong></p><p space-before="10">Parcel-linked evidence, notes, and verification outcomes remain connected to the case record instead of being lost across disconnected inspection channels.</p></text>

  <shape id="card3" type="rect" x="654" y="438" width="568" height="136" fill="surface" stroke="border" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="card3t" x="680" y="462" width="516" height="88" font="body" size="18" color="ink" line-height="1.3"><p><strong color="brand">Supervisory reconciliation</strong></p><p space-before="10">Replay, exception handling, and signed audit outputs help FCT leadership align what happened in the field with what becomes part of the official land and title record.</p></text>

  <text id="footer" x="58" y="686" width="640" height="18" font="caption" size="12" color="muted" wrap="false">IDLR-PTS Platform | Federal Capital Territory</text>
